@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``wait_exponential`` no longer computes the exponential once it has
+    passed ``max``. Long-running retries previously paid for an ever-growing
+    power on every attempt; the result is unchanged.
